  "plain": "The TR3B, a rumoured secret triangle-shaped aircraft, is said to have been built under a programme run by the National Reconnaissance Office, the agency that runs spy satellites, together with the CIA and the National Security Agency. The online researcher UAPGerb passes this on as the claim of a man named Edgar Fouche, saying Fouche \"said that the program was spearheaded by NRO, CIA and NSA.\" If it is true, spy agencies and not just the Air Force were behind the craft."
